e app', 'Add the Notes List widget to the home screen', 'Confirm the widget works normally', 'Log out of the app', 'Tap the widget on the home screen'], 'expected_behavior': \"The widget should show 'Log in to use widget' and open the login screen when tapped.\", 'actual_behavior': 'A new note is opened and the widget becomes blank.'}\n\n### [Functionality-driven COT]\nLet's think step by step.\n1. Function Identification: The tested function is tr__24-new.\n2. Expected Path: Please predict the exploration steps for this function based on the above information.\n3. Actual Path: The tested function sequence is as follows:\n(1) The 1st page is Back, Overview, Home, Open, Money Manager Ex, your_data, Search, Cash Accounts + click feature=\"Open\"\n(2) The 2nd page is Back, Overview, Home, Closed, Money Manager Ex, your_data, Search, Cash Accounts + click feature=\"Categories\"\n(3) The 3rd page is Back, Overview, Switch input method, Home, Open, Money Manager Ex, Categories, Clear query + click feature=\"com.money.manager.ex:id/fab\"\n(4) The 4th page is Back, Overview, Switch input method, Home, Choose a type, Category, Subcategory, CANCEL + click feature=\"Category\"\n(5) The 5th page is Back, Overview, Home, Add Category, Category, CANCEL, OK, 9:56 + click feature=\"Category\"\n(6) The 6th page is Back, Overview, Switch input method, Home, Add Category, Category, CANCEL, OK + input feature=\"com.money.manager.ex:id/editTextCategName\" text=\"A_Test_Category\"\n(7) The 7th page is Back, Overview, Switch input method, Home, Add Category, A_Test_Category, CANCEL, OK + click feature=\"OK\"\n(8) The 8th page is Back, Overview, Switch input method, Home, Open, Money Manager Ex, Categories, Clear query + click feature=\"com.money.manager.ex:id/fab\"\n(9) The 9th page is Back, Overview, Switch input method, Home, Choose a type, Category, Subcategory, CANCEL + click feature=\"Subcategory\"\n(10) The 10th page is Back, Overview, Home, Add Subcategory, A_Test_Category, Subcate